{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight through zombie infested islands of increasing difficulty using mutated flowers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/6048db37def4c1a56d6961ca5b82a12a.avif?t=1757796976\" width=500 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebloom all of the zombie infested islands  from just a single flower. Rush to grow the strongest flowers before the zombies overrun everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plant, pick, survive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers have a small chance to mutate into something different each time they grow. Plant flowers near each other to cross pollinate into the most powerful flower types. 125 different flowers types to discover. Each flower type has a unique set of 3 powers. Use them all to fight off the incoming zombies and reclaim each island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/fa83eb45e7a9d95eccb03e754802a331.avif?t=1757796976\" width=500 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect your flowers from hungry zombies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the zombie's main course but they'll stop to snack on a tasty flower if they fancy. Consumed flowers can have disastrous effects!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat the zombie boss for each island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fastest, strongest and hungriest zombie is the final challenge for each island. Use your best flowers to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823300/extras/3a2d9d326d0299863606727806139e63.avif?t=1757796976\" width=500 height=300 /></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/a